{"2211000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INANIMA", "steam_appid": 2211000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/604e29359502e4dbd67bc50b0f696d61.avif?t=1787745117\" width=640 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jacob Miller's life is a mess, with no future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything will change after receiving the invitation to participate in the last stage of a new food product. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the ten days that the trial will last, the participants will undergo a strange program of physical and sensory stimulation based on a new way of understanding food production and human nutrition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial will be carried out in full isolation at the Spira food and nutrition facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of something that will change the future of humanity, be part of Spira. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/37deab309eaecbf8f9011c4dde5c818b.poster.avif?t=1787745117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/37deab309eaecbf8f9011c4dde5c818b.webm?t=1787745117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/37deab309eaecbf8f9011c4dde5c818b.mp4?t=1787745117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INANIMA is a classic survival horror experience with a pixel art aesthetic. Solve puzzles, investigate secrets, and face nightmarish creatures as you fight to keep your life and sanity safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/10c5b66a33561016361f64d242fa221c.poster.avif?t=1787745117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/10c5b66a33561016361f64d242fa221c.webm?t=1787745117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/10c5b66a33561016361f64d242fa221c.mp4?t=1787745117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Pixel-Art aesthetics with dynamic lighting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system with a wide variety of ranged and melee weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim at enemies' vital areas to deal more damage or shoot at their limbs to slow them down. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources to upgrade your weapons and equipment. Make your weapons more powerful or precise. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying enemies with behaviors that will adapt to the environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are sensitive to light and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/a85f592177a4b7f8930ab3eddf741553.poster.avif?t=1787745117\" width=516 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/a85f592177a4b7f8930ab3eddf741553.webm?t=1787745117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/a85f592177a4b7f8930ab3eddf741553.mp4?t=1787745